{title: Ye Raate Ye Mausam}
{artist: Asha Bhosle Kishore Kumar Ravi}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Yeh raatein yeh mausam
[Em]Nadee [B]ka kinara,
[Em]yeh chanchal Hawaa
[Em]Kahaa do [Am]Dillon ne
[D]Ki milkar [G]kabhi hum
[C]na [B]honge judaa
[Em]Yeh kya [Am]baat hai
[D]aaj ki [Em]chandni mein
[Em]Ki hum [Am]kho gaye
[D]pyaar ki [Em]raagini mein
[Em]Yeh baahon [D]mein baahein,
[Em]yeh [D]behki nigahe
[Em]Lo [D]aane lagaa [C]zindagi [B]ka mazaa
[Em]Sitoran [Am]ki mehfil
[D]mein [Em]karke ishara
[Em]Kahaa ab [Am]toh saara
[D]jahan [Em]hai tumhara
[Em]Mohabbat [D]jawaan ho
[Em]khula [D]aasman ho
[Em]Kare [D]koyi dil [C]arzu [B]aur kya
[Em]Kasam [Am]hai tumhe
[D]tum agar [Em]mujhse ruthe
[Em]Rahe saans [Am]jab tak
[Am]yeh bandhan [Em]na toote
[Em]Tumhe dil [D]diya hai
[Em]yeh waada [D]kiya hai
[Em]Sanam [D]main [C]tumhari [B]rahungi sadaa
